liftMatrixToEN -- Lifts a matrix between bundles on the scroll to the associated Eagon-Northcott type complexes
***************************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        A=liftMatrixToEN(Psi,e)
  * Inputs:
      * Psi, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, the matrix that defines map
        between vector bundles on the scroll.
      * e, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, the type of the scroll $P(E)$
  * Outputs:
      * A, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, the induced map

Description
===========

Given a map between vector bundles F and G on a normalized scroll of type e,
this function computes the induced map between the first modules in the
Eagon-Northcott type resolution of F and G.



+---------------------------------------------+
|i1 : (g,k,n) = (8,5,1000)                    |
|                                             |
|o1 = (8, 5, 1000)                            |
|                                             |
