resCurveOnScroll -- Computes the relative canonical resolution
**************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        resX=resCurveOnScroll(Jcan,g,l)
        resX=resCurveOnScroll(Jcan,g)
  * Inputs:
      * Jcan, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, the ideal of a genus g
        curve with a degree k line bundle in terms of generators on the scroll
      * g, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the genus of C
      * l, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the length limit of the
        resolution
  * Outputs:
      * resX, a *note complex: (Complexes)Complex,, the relative canonical
        resolution

Description
===========

This function computes the relative canonical resolution by picking syzygies of
correct degree in each step until the length limit is reached.



+-------------------------------------------+
|i1 : (g,k,n) = (8,5,1000);                 |
+-------------------------------------------+
|i2 : Ican = canCurveWithFixedScroll(g,k,n);|
|                                           |
|               ZZ                          |
|o2 : Ideal of ----[t ..t ]                 |
|              1009  0   7                  |
+-------------------------------------------+
|i3 : Jcan = curveOnScroll(Ican,g,k);       |
|                                           |
|               ZZ                          |
|o3 : Ideal of ----[pp ..pp , v..w]         |
|              1009   0    3                |
+-------------------------------------------+
|i4 : resX = resCurveOnScroll(Jcan,g,2);    |
+-------------------------------------------+
|i5 : betti resX                            |
|                                           |
|            0 1 2 3                        |
|o5 = total: 1 5 5 1                        |
|         0: 1 . . .                        |
|         1: . . . .                        |
|         2: . 4 1 .                        |
|         3: . 1 4 .                        |
|         4: . . . .                        |
|         5: . . . 1                        |
|                                           |
|o5 : BettiTally                            |
+-------------------------------------------+

